              <article class="post-424133 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-deals category-features category-mcdonalds tag-maccas-delivery tag-maccas-delivery-uber tag-maccas-delivery-ubereats tag-maccas-mcdelivery-ubereats tag-maccas-uber tag-maccas-ubereat tag-maccas-ubers tag-mcdelivery tag-mcdonalds-delivery tag-mcdonalds-delivery-uber tag-mcdonalds-delivery-ubereats tag-mcdonalds-mcdelivery-ubereats tag-mcdonalds-uber tag-mcdonalds-ubereat tag-mcdonalds-ubereats tag-mcdonalds-ubers">
    <div class="post-inner group">

      <h1 class="post-title entry-title">McDonald’s Australia Offers World of Warcraft: Forever Beta Key for 1,000 MyMacca’s Points</h1>
  <p class="post-byline">
       by     <span class="vcard author">
       <span class="fn"><a href="https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/author/will/" rel="author">Will Hawke</a></span>
     </span>
     &middot;
                                            <time class="published" datetime="2026-09-16T00:14:41+10:00">September 16, 2026, 12:14 am AEST</time>
                      </p>

                                
      <div class="clear"></div>

      <div class="entry themeform">
        <div class="entry-inner">
          <div class="fruga-dominos-shopback" id="fruga-19281062"><script>
function activateDealDominos(message, dealUrl) {
    // Show the alert with the provided message
    alert(message);

    // Open in a new tab
    window.open(dealUrl, '_blank');
}

function openCouponPH(element, element2, element3) {
  var $temp = $("<input>");
  $("body").append($temp);
  $temp.val($(element).text()).select();
  document.execCommand("copy");
  $temp.remove();
    alert("Coupon Code: " + $(element).text() + "\n\nDeal: " + element2 + ".\n\nThe coupon code for this deal - " + $(element).text() +  " - has been copied to your clipboard! Enter your pickup or delivery details when the page opens to activate the deal!");
window.open(element3,'_blank');
}
</script>
</div><p><a href="https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas.jpg"><picture><source  sizes='(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px' type="image/webp" data-srcset="https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas-300x136.jpg.webp 300w, https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas-1024x463.jpg.webp 1024w, https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas.jpg.webp 1920w"><img decoding="async" class="alignleft size-medium wp-image-424134 lazyload" src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAASwAAACIAQAAAAB1/OuUAAAAAnRSTlMAAHaTzTgAAAAcSURBVFjD7cExAQAAAMKg9U9tDQ+gAAAAAAC+DBS4AAGe3OziAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC" alt="McDonald’s Australia Offers World of Warcraft: Forever Beta Key for 1,000 MyMacca’s Points 4" width="300" height="136" title="McDonald’s Australia Offers World of Warcraft: Forever Beta Key for 1,000 MyMacca’s Points 29"   data-eio="p" data-src="https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas-300x136.jpg" data-srcset="https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas-300x136.jpg 300w, https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas-1024x463.jpg 1024w, https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas.jpg 1920w" data-sizes="auto" data-eio-rwidth="300" data-eio-rheight="136" /></picture><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignleft size-medium wp-image-424134" src="https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas-300x136.jpg" alt="McDonald’s Australia Offers World of Warcraft: Forever Beta Key for 1,000 MyMacca’s Points 4" width="300" height="136" title="McDonald’s Australia Offers World of Warcraft: Forever Beta Key for 1,000 MyMacca’s Points 29" srcset="https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas-300x136.jpg 300w, https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas-1024x463.jpg 1024w, https://www.frugalfeeds.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-MyMaccas.jpg 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" data-eio="l" /></noscript></a>McDonald&rsquo;s Australia has launched a new <strong>MyMacca&rsquo;s Partner Reward</strong>, allowing members to redeem <strong>1,000 MyMacca&rsquo;s Rewards points for a World of Warcraft: Forever Beta Key</strong>.</p><p>The reward is available through the <strong>MyMacca&rsquo;s App while stocks last</strong>, giving Australian players another way to access the upcoming beta without purchasing one of Blizzard&rsquo;s premium World of Warcraft: Forever upgrade packs.</p><div id="toc_container" class="no_bullets"><p class="toc_title">Contents</p><ul class="toc_list"><li><a href="#Get_a_WoW_Forever_Beta_Key_for_1000_MyMaccarsquos_Points">Get a WoW Forever Beta Key for 1,000 MyMacca&rsquo;s Points</a></li><li><a href="#How_to_Redeem_the_WoW_Forever_Beta_Key">How to Redeem the WoW Forever Beta Key</a></li><li><a href="#Beta_Starts_September_17">Beta Starts September 17</a></li><li><a href="#No_WoW_Subscription_Required_for_the_Beta">No WoW Subscription Required for the Beta</a></li><li><a href="#Redeem_Your_MyMaccarsquos_Points_by_October_20">Redeem Your MyMacca&rsquo;s Points by October 20</a></li></ul></div>
<h2><span id="Get_a_WoW_Forever_Beta_Key_for_1000_MyMaccarsquos_Points"><strong>Get a WoW Forever Beta Key for 1,000 MyMacca&rsquo;s Points</strong></span></h2><p>The reward costs <strong>1,000 MyMacca&rsquo;s points</strong> and provides a unique code that can be redeemed through Battle.net for access to the <strong>World of Warcraft: Forever Beta</strong>.</p><div  class="fruga-2df54300ff0427e80687326e04b17b46 fruga-after-1-paragraph" id="fruga-2df54300ff0427e80687326e04b17b46"></div><div  class="fruga-eb2ca4c366a56d3096fa28aab6d354ad fruga-every-5-paragraph" id="fruga-eb2ca4c366a56d3096fa28aab6d354ad"></div><p>There is a limit of:</p><ul>
<li><strong>1 Beta Key per MyMacca&rsquo;s account</strong></li>
<li><strong>1 Beta Key redemption per World of Warcraft account</strong></li>
<li>Available <strong>while stocks last</strong></li>
</ul><p>No additional McDonald&rsquo;s purchase is required when redeeming the reward if you already have enough points in your account.</p><h2><span id="How_to_Redeem_the_WoW_Forever_Beta_Key"><strong>How to Redeem the WoW Forever Beta Key</strong></span></h2><p>To get your key:</p><ol>
<li>Open the <strong>MyMacca&rsquo;s App</strong>.</li>
<li>Head to <strong>Rewards &amp; Deals</strong>.</li>
<li>Scroll down to <strong>Partner Rewards</strong>.</li>
<li>Select the <strong>World of Warcraft: Forever Beta Key</strong>.</li>
<li>Redeem <strong>1,000 MyMacca&rsquo;s points</strong>.</li>
<li>Copy the unique code displayed in the app.</li>
<li>Log into your <strong>Battle.net account</strong>.</li>
<li>Go to <strong>Redeem Code</strong> and enter your key.</li>
</ol><p>Once activated, the Beta will become available through the Battle.net desktop application during the testing period.</p><h2><span id="Beta_Starts_September_17"><strong>Beta Starts September 17</strong></span></h2><p>Blizzard has confirmed the <strong>World of Warcraft: Forever Beta begins September 17, 2026</strong>.</p><div  class="fruga-42302f5db0569cfea8ea1f754da7d212 fruga-every-5-paragraph" id="fruga-42302f5db0569cfea8ea1f754da7d212"></div><p>World of Warcraft: Forever is a new permanent version of WoW built around a reimagined original Azeroth, with players eventually progressing to level 60 alongside new stories, systems and updates. The full game launches globally on <strong>November 4, 2026</strong>.</p><p>For Australian players using the McDonald&rsquo;s promotion, McDonald&rsquo;s says Beta access will close on <strong>October 22, 2026</strong>. Beta character progression <strong>won&rsquo;t carry over to the full release.</strong></p><h2><span id="No_WoW_Subscription_Required_for_the_Beta"><strong>No WoW Subscription Required for the Beta</strong></span></h2><p>You <strong>do not need an active World of Warcraft subscription</strong> to use the McDonald&rsquo;s Beta Key.</p><p>You will need:</p><ul>
<li>A compatible <strong>PC</strong></li>
<li>Internet connection</li>
<li>A <strong>Battle.net account</strong></li>
<li>The <strong>Battle.net desktop app</strong></li>
</ul><p>Once World of Warcraft: Forever officially launches, an active World of Warcraft subscription or Game Time will be required to continue playing.</p><h2><span id="Redeem_Your_MyMaccarsquos_Points_by_October_20"><strong>Redeem Your MyMacca&rsquo;s Points by October 20</strong></span></h2><div  class="fruga-43218a40f5a3332ac331c926b7eec6bb fruga-every-5-paragraph" id="fruga-43218a40f5a3332ac331c926b7eec6bb"></div><p>The World of Warcraft: Forever reward can be claimed through the MyMacca&rsquo;s App until <strong>11:59pm AEDT on October 20, 2026</strong>, unless the available Beta Keys run out earlier.</p><p>Your unique key must also be activated through Battle.net by <strong>11:59pm AEDT on October 20</strong>.</p><p>The reward is available to both <strong>new and existing World of Warcraft customers</strong> and cannot be resold, returned or exchanged for cash.</p><p>With the <strong>WoW Forever Beta starting September 17</strong>, MyMacca&rsquo;s members with 1,000 spare points can currently secure access directly through the McDonald&rsquo;s App while keys remain available.</p><p>For more McDonald&rsquo;s deals, click on one of these links:</p><style>
